  - **Leaflet** — maps and geospatial data (`/app/libs/leaflet.js` + CSS). **Required for geographic data** — never hand-draw SVG continent shapes. Use OpenStreetMap tiles or a minimal tile provider.
- SVG for icons and simple graphics — never use external image URLs unless user provides them
